<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Semiconductor equipment cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Semiconductor equipment cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Michael O'Brien initiated coverage of Applied Materials Inc and Novellus Systems Inc with short- and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- said expects Applied Material to earn $2.54 a share in fiscal 1997 and $3.78 a share in fiscal 1998.  Set an $80 price target.</p>
<p>-- said expects Novellus to earn $4.13 a share in fiscal 1997 and $5.55 a share in fiscal 1998.  Set a $95 a share price target.</p>
</text>
